TITLE:: ProbeWaterfall
summary:: Real-time 2.5D stacked line waterfall spectrum
categories:: GUI>Visuals
related:: Classes/Probe, Classes/ProbeWaterfallView, Classes/ProbeSpectrogram, Classes/ProbeSpectrum

DESCRIPTION::
ProbeWaterfall renders a 2.5D isometric stacked line waterfall spectrum analyzer.
Lines roll from the foreground to background with perspective offset and theme gradient shading.

list::
## Zero duplicate FFT cost: shares ProbeSpectrumSource with link::Classes/ProbeSpectrogram:: via link::Classes/ProbeBroker::
## Bounded line memory (default 48 historical frames)
## Shaded depth cues from background subtext to foreground signal/warning colors
## Interactive freeze control (Space)
::

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
Creates and displays a new ProbeWaterfall window.

ARGUMENT:: server
The target link::Classes/Server:: (defaults to code::Server.default::).

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
Audio bus index to analyze (default 0).

ARGUMENT:: numBands
Number of logarithmic frequency bands (default 64).

ARGUMENT:: theme
Theme name symbol or link::Classes/ProbeTheme:: instance.

ARGUMENT:: updateFreq
Analysis update rate in Hz (default 20 Hz).

ARGUMENT:: numLines
Number of stacked isometric historical traces (default 48).

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: window
Returns the underlying link::Classes/Window::.

METHOD:: waterfallView
Returns the underlying link::Classes/ProbeWaterfallView::.

METHOD:: theme
Update active theme dynamically.

ARGUMENT:: aTheme
Theme symbol or link::Classes/ProbeTheme::.

METHOD:: fontScale
Get or set the active typography scaling factor.

ARGUMENT:: aScale
Float font scale between 0.6 and 2.5.

METHOD:: toggleFreeze
Toggle pause/unpause of the waterfall rolling display.

METHOD:: close
Close the window and release broker subscriptions.

EXAMPLES::

code::
s.boot;
x = { Saw.ar(SinOsc.kr(0.2).range(100, 3000)) * 0.2 }.play;
w = Probe.waterfall(s, 0, 64, \graphite);
::
